# C-VARIADIC: excess positional args collected into variadic Dict (integer-keyed).
# Unannotated ...rest collects excess positionals as Dict{0: T0, 1: T1, ...}.
# Typed buckets (...x@T) collect into Seq; the unannotated rest collects into Dict.
[
  f: [fn [let _ _ ...rest] rest]
  result: [f 1 2 3 4 5]
]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(_, _, rest), "result": Dict({Int(0): Int(3), Int(1): Int(4), Int(2): Int(5)})})
